5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a fair system that doesn't destroy our neighborly relations. I'll look into the history of our conflicts and other buildings.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I just want to know if things are actually unfair right now! I'll check the minutes and the sticker register.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The physical layout and the morning rush are the real issues. I'll observe the departures and the rain exposure.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Money always comes up, yet we're blind to the numbers. I'll check the ledger and the ward park's rates.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Maintenance and administration are often overlooked. I'll examine the treasurer's file and the supplier's frame trial.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
